rkers/differential/14068805/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-333360" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "$[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ only"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/state.json" "file_sha256" "746d5e046d23d4ad06c4544810f7e0f65c91c067618bc9f939723cad8012347f" "basis" 2345 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-335558" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=2x(t)-y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)={y}^{2}(t)-x(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives all equilibrium points of the system of differential equations above?" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/state.json" "file_sha256" "746d5e046d23d4ad06c4544810f7e0f65c91c067618bc9f939723cad8012347f" "basis" 2345 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-335558" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The equilibrium (fixed) points of a system ${x}^{′}(t)=f(x,y)$ are the points for which $f(x,y)=0.$ So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-y=0 \\\\ {y}^{2}-x=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve the first equation for $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-y=0\\,⇒\\,y=2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute $y$ into the second equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-x & =0 \\\\ (2x)^{2}-x & =0 \\\\ 4{x}^{2}-x & =0 \\\\ x(4x-1) & =0 \\\\ x & =0,\\text{ }\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute $y:$\n\n- For $x=0,$ we get $y=2\\cdot 0=0.$\n\n- For $x=\\frac{1}{4},$ we get $y=2\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\nTherefore, the equilibrium points are\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\,\\text{and}\\,[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/state.json" "file_sha256" "746d5e046d23d4ad06c4544810f7e0f65c91c067618bc9f939723cad8012347f" "basis" 2345 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-335558" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "478e0ffeeb616cde990750ee6d12db861d4e636d27e873f81d582bbc202ae000" "basis" 2345 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-335558" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/state.json" "file_sha256" "746d5e046d23d4ad06c4544810f7e0f65c91c067618bc9f939723cad8012347f" "basis" 2345 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-335558" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "$[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}]$ only"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068805/state.json" "file_sha256" "746d5e046d23d4ad06c4544810f7e0f65c91c067618bc9f939723cad8012347f" "basis